| control | pair visits | edge visits | active attraction | net x0 |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| No edge | 1 | 0 | 0 | -1.000000 |
| One edge | 1 | 1 | 1 | -0.646447 |
| Three records | 1 | 3 | 3 | 0.060660 |
| Edge plus loops | 1 | 3 | 1 | -0.646447 |

